WEBVTT

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.107 --> 00:00:03.230
The Bookings page is where you work every day.

00:00:03.364 --> 00:00:06.510
One column per staff member, one block per booking:

00:00:06.619 --> 00:00:08.510
one look, and you see the whole day.

00:00:08.938 --> 00:00:11.744
In this lesson, I'll show you how to read the calendar,

00:00:11.694 --> 00:00:14.350
add a booking for a customer, and update its status.

00:00:14.935 --> 00:00:15.871
Tap Bookings.

00:00:16.068 --> 00:00:19.434
At the top are the number of appointments today, how many are done,

00:00:19.384 --> 00:00:20.671
and the expected revenue.

00:00:21.159 --> 00:00:24.431
A block with a globe icon was booked online by the customer.

00:00:24.656 --> 00:00:26.351
The others were added by the salon.

00:00:27.022 --> 00:00:30.911
Tap a staff member's name at the top, to hide or show their column.

00:00:31.428 --> 00:00:35.167
On the bar at the bottom, tap the arrows to move to another day,

00:00:35.117 --> 00:00:36.838
tap the date to pick any day,

00:00:37.106 --> 00:00:37.878
and switch the view:

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.118
Day, Week, or Month.

00:00:40.691 --> 00:00:43.870
To add a booking for a customer who phones or walks in,

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:46.599
press and hold an empty slot for about a second,

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.159
at the right time, in the right staff column.

00:00:49.428 --> 00:00:51.319
The form Book for a customer opens.

00:00:51.589 --> 00:00:54.919
Choose the Service, and enter the Customer name and Phone number.

00:00:55.189 --> 00:00:59.959
To send the customer a confirmation email, add their email, and tick the box below.

00:01:00.139 --> 00:01:01.239
Then tap Book.

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:03.897
Tap a booking to see its details:

00:01:04.006 --> 00:01:07.017
the service, the time, and the total to collect.

00:01:07.352 --> 00:01:11.657
A small line below tells you when it was booked online, or when the salon added it.

00:01:12.044 --> 00:01:16.057
When the customer has been served, tap Pay at the counter, or Complete.

00:01:16.399 --> 00:01:18.857
If they don't turn up, tap No-show.

00:01:19.124 --> 00:01:21.097
And to cancel, tap Cancel.

00:01:21.744 --> 00:01:25.436
To move a booking to another time, drag its block to the new slot.

00:01:25.865 --> 00:01:28.396
The system asks you to confirm before it moves.

00:01:28.572 --> 00:01:29.916
And that's the Bookings page.

00:01:30.077 --> 00:01:31.356
Now take the quiz below.
